SUMMARY:Hot Drink Hopping
DESCRIPTION:Friendly People in Asheville\nIt's cold outside\, so let's war
 m up with some hot cocktails! 🍹🔥\n\nWe'll kick things off at **Tiki 
 Easy**\, a hidden speakeasy in the back of Hi-Wire Brewing's South Slope l
 ocation. At **7:45 PM**\, we'll walk over to **The Times Bar**\, then at *
 *8:45 PM**\, we'll head to **The Crow & Quill** for some hot buttered rum!
 \n\nCome hang out\, meet some new people\, and enjoy a cozy night hopping 
 between some of Asheville's coolest bars.\n\nSanta says **Please drink res
 ponsibly!** 🎅
